## Smell-Free Patterns ✅

**`addThrowsOnNegativeCount`** (line 117) is well-written:
- Uses `assertThrows` with a specific exception type
- Asserts on the message content
- Tests exactly one behavior
- No magic numbers, no external resources, no sleep

This is the pattern every other test in the class should aspire to.

